<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  L4[&quot;专家层&lt;br/&gt;5 个 ExpertSpec，各持 1-3 个工具&lt;br/&gt;graph/experts.py&quot;]</span></span>
